{"name": "Modulink", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"348\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/bbc2aec3217206d18a08172b7d0aa888.poster.avif?t=1791828383\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/bbc2aec3217206d18a08172b7d0aa888.webm?t=1791828383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/bbc2aec3217206d18a08172b7d0aa888.mp4?t=1791828383\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Centuries after a catastrophe shattered humanity\u2019s understanding of its own technology, scattered communities endure among the relics of the Old World. You are Tinker, a young researcher who ventures beyond the safety of home with Repo, your hovering companion and digital journal, to recover what was forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/d32801a2a092d80a7aab25d26f9f9811.avif?t=1791828383\" width=\"1060\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find Modules and connect them into circuits to unlock new attacks and abilities, and discover unexpected effects. Change their order and placement to reshape your build on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"656\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/f4ad340795074655bcafce383255993f.poster.avif?t=1791828383\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/f4ad340795074655bcafce383255993f.webm?t=1791828383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/f4ad340795074655bcafce383255993f.mp4?t=1791828383\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modules are not just for combat. They can also open doors, repair machines, solve puzzles, and help the people you meet. Learn how each Module works, then apply that knowledge as you explore the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"660\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/e275908a90b1e5306a3fe795e4281027.poster.avif?t=1791828383\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/e275908a90b1e5306a3fe795e4281027.webm?t=1791828383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/e275908a90b1e5306a3fe795e4281027.mp4?t=1791828383\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/f7a0c87ffa48a4258e0527d8792f4998.avif?t=1791828383\" width=\"1060\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modulink does not hand out answers. Every mysterious Module must be tested, observed and understood. Record your theories in Repo, learn from the people you meet, and carry insight from one expedition into the next. You may lose what you found. What you learn is yours forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"402\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/ee8a9dad1a823cd260807628f1173100.poster.avif?t=1791828383\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/ee8a9dad1a823cd260807628f1173100.webm?t=1791828383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/ee8a9dad1a823cd260807628f1173100.mp4?t=1791828383\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/91752a5cbbe3010b3a4f833cccdb106c.avif?t=1791828383\" width=\"1060\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cross hand-crafted combat arenas, traversal challenges, hidden rooms and circuit puzzles, procedurally assembled into a different route each run. Explore, backtrack and improvise with the limited parts you uncover. Hostile machines make every encounter a test: learn how they fight, then build the answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"366\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/bb90f3930122a76d2576e947c1e57657.poster.avif?t=1791828383\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/bb90f3930122a76d2576e947c1e57657.webm?t=1791828383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/bb90f3930122a76d2576e947c1e57657.mp4?t=1791828383\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/de568ef70deca81c45d650e71d84e62d.avif?t=1791828383\" width=\"1060\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The apocalypse did not end humanity, but scattered it. Journey from a bright mega city to a dense factory and a lightless coastal quarry, meeting communities that have learned to survive apart. Restore the systems they depend on, rebuild trust and reconnect settlements by applying your discoveries beyond combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/813112102c919a95b4e41ab2bb9f64da.poster.avif?t=1791828383\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/813112102c919a95b4e41ab2bb9f64da.webm?t=1791828383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/813112102c919a95b4e41ab2bb9f64da.mp4?t=1791828383\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/7ee74922f6e714f07159fe4fb16db8e0.avif?t=1791828383\" width=\"1060\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The obvious function of a Module is rarely the whole truth. Hidden patterns underlie manufacturer-specific traits, configurations and unexpected combinations of effects. Ruins keep records. Repo keeps more than notes. And some mysteries are meant to outlive a single run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"382\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/836460bb6f95ede4f3325d5c63aba524.poster.avif?t=1791828383\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/836460bb6f95ede4f3325d5c63aba524.webm?t=1791828383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/836460bb6f95ede4f3325d5c63aba524.mp4?t=1791828383\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/extras/106219510ce38b4661778b2a20330a79.avif?t=1791828383\" width=\"1060\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A third-person action roguelite set in a hopeful post-apocalyptic world, where knowledge is the most powerful weapon. Discover mysterious Modules, learn how they work, and combine them into circuits that change your abilities. Fight deadly machines and use what you learn to repair the world.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952760/38b8f9eb91bb1a495748644370359cd2e9ed7f9d/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1791828383", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Adventure", "Action", "Puzzle", "Mystery", "Exploration"], "developers": "brainglyph", "publishers": "brainglyph", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4952760", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "12 October 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/1ocGbQP16KY", "first_seen": 1791756000.0, "review_rank": 21}